  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `crates/ui/src/egui_app/ai_chat/` (`mod.rs`, `panel.rs`, `state.rs`, `turn.rs`, `transport.rs`, `worker.rs`, `worker_mcp.rs`) for the in-app AI Chat dock panel, provider presets, offline guard, opt-in attachments, background worker (`wasm32` stub included), confirmation prompts, and Turn Undo.\n- Added `Panel::AiChat`, `Tab::AiChat`, `PanelsOpen::ai_chat`, and View door row `\"AI Chat\"` in `crates/ui/src/state.rs`, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/layout/mod.rs`.\n- Changed `LayoutRequest::Toggle` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/layout/mod.rs` to call `show(dock, tab_of(p))` so tabs opened beside `Properties` become active immediately.\n- Added `History::done_len()` in `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs` and wired `State::ai_mcp_tx` / `State::ai_mcp_inbox` through `crates/ui/src/mcp_host.rs` (`pump` and shared `answer_request`).\n- Registered `EventLoopProxy::send_event(())` wakeups in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell_window.rs` and shut down worker state on `Shell::shutdown` and `CommandKind::NewDocument`.\n- Added offline UI and safety tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ai_chat/` and recorded decisions in `docs/decisions/1946-ai-chat-panel.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe workspace had MCP tool dispatch and provider schema mapping, but lacked the in-app AI Chat dock panel, background worker loop, in-process MCP inbox channel wiring, safety guards, and offline UI tests requested by #1946.\n\n## Tests\n- Pinning tests (`cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib ai_chat`: red before fix with compile `E0432`; after fix: `11 passed; 0 failed` in `0.36s`):\n  - `egui_app::ai_chat::transport::tests::offline_policy_refuses_cloud_and_allows_local`\n  - `egui_app::ai_chat::transport::tests::base64_and_png_round_trip`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::basic::view_door_opens_ai_chat_tab_beside_properties_with_expected_controls`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::basic::chat_submission_dispatches_tools_through_inbox_shows_cards_and_opt_in_attachments`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::basic::cancel_stops_running_worker_via_atomic_flag_and_leaves_document_unchanged`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::basic::offline_only_blocks_cloud_providers_before_transport_and_allows_local`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::basic::fallback_readonly_mode_shows_warning_banner_and_blocks_all_tools`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::undo_turn_reverts_multi_tool_turn_changes_in_one_click_and_guards_later_edits`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::undo_turn_is_disabled_and_refused_after_later_manual_edit`\n  - `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::prompt_json_fallback_gates_mutating_proposals_behind_allow_deny`\n- Mutation checks (all 5 confirmed red when guard disabled, green when restored):\n  - `check_offline_policy` bypassed -> `offline_only_blocks_cloud_providers_before_transport_and_allows_local` failed (`left: 1, right: 0`); restored green.\n  - `requires_confirmation` (`FallbackMode::Native => false`) -> `post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch` failed (timed out waiting for inline Allow/Deny prompt); restored green.\n  - `FallbackMode::ReadOnly` worker guard disabled in `worker.rs` and `worker_mcp.rs` -> `fallback_readonly_mode_shows_warning_banner_and_blocks_all_tools` failed (timed out still running); restored green.\n  - Opt-in `attach_selection` guard bypassed in `ai_chat/state.rs` -> `chat_submission_dispatches_tools_through_inbox_shows_cards_and_opt_in_attachments` failed (`selection must not be sent without opt-in`); restored green.\n  - `ChatTurn::can_undo` `end_depth == Some(current_done_len)` guard removed -> `undo_turn_is_disabled_and_refused_after_later_manual_edit` failed (`later manual edit must disable Undo Turn`); restored green.\n- Gate & clippy:\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`[01] app suites` ok in `294s`, `[02] ui suites` ok in `38s`, wall `5.6 min`, `0 failed`). Note `ui lib` and `ui:shell` passed all non-ignored cases (`6 ignored` in `ui lib` and `1 ignored` in `ui:machine` are pre-existing upstream ignored tests).\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (`0` warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n- Live network HTTP provider endpoint calls (#1945; `DefaultTransport` returns an offline refusal until wired).\n- `wasm32` target compilation and browser event-loop execution.\n- Full GPU window frame rendering (`egui_kittest` headless shell harness exercised panel layout, widgets, and worker draining).\n\n## Overlaps\nTouches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes:\n- `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`: #1738, #2077\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/layout/mod.rs`: #2081\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs`: #1209, #1330, #1798, #1938, #2077, #2093\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs`: #1330, #1798, #2023, #2027, #2081, #2086, #2091\n- `crates/ui/src/state.rs`: #1330, #1798, #2023, #2077\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: #1209, #1330, #1685, #1753, #1931, #1938, #1996, #2023, #2027, #2036, #2068, #2077, #2078, #2081, #2086, #2090, #2091, #2092, #2093\n\nChangelog: Added an offline-safe AI Chat dock panel with background MCP worker, inline confirmation gates, opt-in context attachments, and one-click Turn Undo.\n\nFixes #1946\n\n\n## Before and after screenshots\n\nCaptured from the headless egui shell harness at 1280×720. The shell and AI Chat\ncontrols use the shipping layout. The harness uses a placeholder viewport texture\ninstead of rendering the 3D model; these images demonstrate the panel layout.\n\nBefore: parent `c86d6db35`, before the AI Chat panel was added.\n\n![Before: AI Chat panel absent](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/70003ab32dab66b1957db38696f2453b4e22f594/2094/before.png)\n\nAfter: the AI Chat panel opened from View, including the disabled screenshot\ncontrol and the visible capture-unavailable message from this review fix.\n\n![After: AI Chat panel open](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/70003ab32dab66b1957db38696f2453b4e22f594/2094/after.png)\n\nImages are stored only on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch.\n",
